{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24820","headline":"赋得玉水记方流 · 吴丹","name":"赋得玉水记方流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉泉何处记，四折水纹浮。\n润下宁踰矩，居方在上流。\n映空虚漾漾，涵白净悠悠。\n影碎疑冲斗，光清耐触舟。\n珪璋分辨状，沙砾共怀柔。\n愿赴朝宗日，萦回入御沟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}